                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I got this for $1 and feel I got my money's worth after 45 minutes of play. Beat the first 4 bosses then didn't feel like I wanted to play again. But I came back the next day because I realized even though it's easy, it is a good, simple pass time game.\n\nIt is very simple, and actually pretty easy. But I like that it's well done and casual. Weapons are totally OP if you collect them wisely and stack them.\n\nAn easy buy for an hour or two of twinstick fun, without too much frustration. I got around 4 hours and I think that's it for me.\n\nOh yeah, the sound track is absolutely AMAZING. Worth the money alone for that.",
